direction: right


implement: |md
  # 1. Implement and REFACTOR

  **Produces (advisory)**

  - One `givn outline report` per behavior batch
  - Changed Rust/Python components and relevant neighbors
  - Per-component call tree, then metric hints

  **Checks**

  - Nothing; the report never blocks
  - Confirm suspected concerns against source
| {
  style.fill: "#eef2ff"
  style.stroke: "#4f46e5"
  style.border-radius: 10
  style.font-size: 20
}

review: |md
  # 2. Review

  **Uses**

  - Relevant current reports as evidence
  - No per-unit verdict, waiver, or forced reviewer

  **Checks**

  - Reuse current evidence; rerun only if structurally stale
  - Assess unsupported languages directly from source
  - The outline alone cannot block review or archive
| {
  style.fill: "#fff7ed"
  style.stroke: "#ea580c"
  style.border-radius: 10
  style.font-size: 20
}

archive: |md
  # 3. Archive

  **Produces**

  - Nothing new

  **Checks**

  - No outline gate or verdict
| {
  style.fill: "#f0fdf4"
  style.stroke: "#16a34a"
  style.border-radius: 10
  style.font-size: 20
}

implement -> review: "next phase"
review -> archive: "next phase"
